{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10100254","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10100254","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1010025401:1":{"text":"Hang on, what did you just give me?! The weight and color of this silver coin are all wrong.","source_cn":"等一下，你刚才给我的是什么？这银币重量和成色看着不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2BC019879224E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010025402:1":{"text":"That's hard-earned coin from selling... selling wheat! What's wrong with it?!","source_cn":"那是我卖……卖麦子挣的辛苦钱，哪里不对？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F829E9B344A3A01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010025403:1":{"text":"Wheat? There was just a fire in Northville... You didn't get ripped off, did you? Trying to recoup your losses...","source_cn":"麦子？北村刚刚遭受了火灾……你不会是急于挽回损失，被人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA85251748704F772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010025404:1":{"text":"Look, this silver coin is counterfeit, and it was a shoddy attempt too. Who gave this to you? You'd better go have a word with him!","source_cn":"听我一句，这银币是伪造的，而且工艺很拙劣。谁给你的钱？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95066AC865ECD2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010025405:1":{"text":"Counterfeit? No, you're wrong! I paid you good coin and now, I'm taking what I'm owed.","source_cn":"什么假的，你认错了！钱已经付清，东西我拿走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D27FB6DE4D5F134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010025406:1":{"text":"Hey! Wait!","source_cn":"诶——等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEAB1F641519A846","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010025407:1":{"text":"Hold it, sir!","source_cn":"我说，这位先生，留步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B271D0532AAAB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010025408:1":{"text":"Your money is clearly counterfeit. What are you trying to do here?","source_cn":"你知道这钱是假的吧？明明是一眼就能认出来的伪造品，是想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBA3A385CDEA92C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010025409:1":{"text":"Mind your own business! Move it!","source_cn":"啧……哪来的人管闲事，快让路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D845E4EE93474F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010025410:1":{"text":"It's a case of counterfeiting. As a member of Heroic Order, I can't let this slide. Please come with me.","source_cn":"涉嫌货币伪造，这事我必须得管了——耀光骑士团，请跟我走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D5412086EFDEAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010025411:1":{"text":"The Heroic Order?!","source_cn":"竟然是骑士团？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39630CBC20EEE964","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010025412:1":{"text":"Darkness take you! Only fools go to jail!","source_cn":"可恶！鬼才想去坐牢——和你拼了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57BA72BFAA6652B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1010025413:1":{"text":"A bandit in disguise! Careful, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>!","source_cn":"竟然是盗匪的伪装，<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB5BCEC3DC6A46701","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A bandit in disguise! Careful, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>!","female":"A bandit in disguise! Careful, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>!","variant_male_record_index":"96934","variant_female_record_index":"96935","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:秘银商人":{"text":"Mithril Merchant","source":"秘银商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:可疑的村民":{"text":"Wary Villager","source":"可疑的村民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"Valen","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:盗匪":{"text":"Bandit","source":"盗匪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":4}}